---
// PageOne.astro - The Kinetic ASCII Sculpture & Pure Web3 Slogan
---

<div class="w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center my-auto py-4 sm:py-8 select-none">
  
  <!-- The Real-Time Kinetic ASCII Canvas (Borderless, Floating) -->
  <div class="relative w-full max-w-[920px] h-[300px] sm:h-[380px] md:h-[440px] cursor-crosshair overflow-hidden">
    <canvas
      id="qntx-ascii-canvas"
      class="w-full h-full block"
      aria-label="Interactive QNTX ASCII horizontal unfolding animation"
    ></canvas>
  </div>

  <!-- Bottom Slogan (Restrained, Generous Negative Space, Pure Typography) -->
  <div class="text-center pt-3 sm:pt-6 space-y-3 sm:space-y-4">
    <h1 class="text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base tracking-[0.25em] text-neutral-950 uppercase font-normal select-none">
      Economic Layer for Autonomous AI Agents
    </h1>

    <div class="pt-1">
      <a
        href="https://docs.qntx.org"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-950 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"
        aria-label="Get Started with QuantX"
      >
        <span>[ GET STARTED ]</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
